empty land)":vY(787),"⚓ Maritime":vY(2946),"Strategy game to expand territory. ONLY runs when Maritime event is OPEN; night 00:00–10:00 stops on its own.":vY(1669),"🎁 Bonus":"🎁 Recompensas","Self-Received Maritime Bonus":vY(2001),"⚓ Occupy & Expand":vY(1415),"Auto Capture Cells (expand territory)":vY(1694),"Occupy your own Resource/Totem/Prison space adjacent to the territory → passive income, gradually expanding. Running out of Action Points waits automatically; When End of Durability, return to base.":vY(4122),"Only occupy/attack boxes NEXT to your territory. Hit enemy ground only when WEAKER (force preview) — loss = loss of Endurance.":vY(1803),"⚔️ Antiquities":vY(4187),"Artifact Challenge (1 time/day)":"Desafio de Relíquia (1x/dia)","⚓ Auto Capture & Expand Sea Area":vY(2502),"Enter the map yourself → OCCUPATE the Resource/Totem/Prison box next to the territory (passive income), gradually expanding. When you run out of Action Points, wait for yourself. ONLY when event is open; night 00:00–10:00 stop.":"Entexit no mapa → OCUPA tiles de Recurso/Totem/Prisão ADJACENTES ao seu território (renda passiva), expandindo aos poucos. Espeexit quando os Pontos de Ação acabam. So com o evento aberto; pausa à noite 00:00–10:00.","⚔️ Artifact Challenge (1 time/day)":vY(1084),"Hit the Artifact ONCE every day when you have enough Durability (after hitting it, you will DIE — already counted, ignore it after that).":vY(499),"• Type":vY(1655),"Peaceful (occupies only blank spaces) — safe":vY(352),"+ Conquer weaker enemy lands":vY(3081),"• How weak the enemy is ('+' type)":vY(4381),"Occupy the cell next to your territory (expand step by step). When your durability runs out, return to base. Hit enemy ground only when WEAKER (force preview) — loss = loss of Endurance.":vY(2271),"⚓ Maritime (Season)":vY(3777),"🎁 Receive your own Maritime Bonus":vY(2521),"Self-recognize maritime goals/events when achieved. No fighting.":vY(2522),"⚓ Auto Plow Nautical Map":vY(4347),"Enter the map yourself → sweep the target. The server deals with FORCE — only winning numbers can be played. ONLY runs when the Maritime event is open; stops at night.":vY(305),"• Plow type":vY(2384),"PvE only (monsters/resources/artifacts) — safe":vY(3440),"PvE + weak people + land occupation":vY(1039),"• How weak the person is ('all' type)":"• Que fexitco atacar (modo 'all')","≤ 90% of own strength":vY(3843),"≤ 100%":vY(2967),"≤ 75%":vY(1151),"≤ 50%":vY(452),"Farming the map requires enough Action Points (when you run out, wait for it to cool down). Human/earth only hits when WEAKER (power preview). Lose = lose — 'all' type should be tested carefully.":vY(3339),"Only receive when the cap is FULL (12 o'clock) - do not accept random items to avoid waste (like AFK gifts).":vY(1103),"6 pieces":vY(543),"10 pieces":vY(713),"20 pieces":vY(3603),"Lists are like games. Select 10/20 but the level is not open → the mod will automatically reset to the cap (no error). Mod roll REPEAT so the TOTAL roll is UNLIMITED — run until the end of the Light Ticket.":"Lista como no jogo. Escolher 10/20 sem o nível desbloqueado → o mod reduz pro cap (sem erro). O mod faz roll EM LOOP, então o TOTAL é ILIMITADO — roda até acabar os Tickets.","Number of rolls per time (batch)":vY(1633),"Maximum batch = limit according to your LEVEL (server blocks if exceeded → mod automatically lowers cap). But the ROLL REPEAT mod continuously so the TOTAL number of rolls is UNLIMITED - just let it run until the end of the Light Ticket.":vY(484),"Number of rolls per time (1–100)":vY(4317),"Overcome 20 levels of the game. Need enough Light Tickets; The server can block it if it exceeds the limit. Turn on ▶️ (don't press 'Start' in the game) for the mod to push this number correctly.":vY(888),"🔮 Lamp Roll":"🔮 Lamp Rollada","🔮 Auto Roll Lights":vY(1285),"▶️ TURN ON AUTO ROLL LIGHT":vY(1823),"Number of rolls per time":"Quantidade por roll","8 pieces":vY(4104),"4 pieces":vY(4360),"2 pieces":vY(1449),"1 piece":vY(3398),"🔮 Genie of the Lamp":vY(4078),"🔮 Auto Roll Genie":vY(3588),"Select style + filter, then turn on the ▶️ button at the bottom. Mod lights itself → wears fancy clothes → sells trash, runs underground.":"Escolha o modo + filtro e ligue o botão ▶️ no final. O mod acende a lampada → equipa o que serve → vende o lixo, em segundo plano.","Style of choosing clothes":"Modo de escolha","By index (filter below)":"Por atributo (filtro abaixo)","According to fighting force (stronger → wear)":vY(2896),"Filter (when 'By index')":vY(3965),"🗑️ Sell your own trash":vY(707),"Unsatisfactory items → self-sell (ignore Precious items). ⚠️ Sold forever.":"Item que brain qualifica → vendido (pula Preciosos). ⚠️ Perdido pexit semper.","⚡ Roll nhanh":vY(995),"On/Off":vY(1579),"▶️ TURN ON AUTO ROLL GENIUS":vY(2117),"Turn on and run: light your own lamp + wear cool clothes + sell trash. Turn off to stop.":vY(2973),"🗑️ Selling Unsatisfactory Items + Old Items":vY(1951),"Roll out unsatisfactory items (not matching/not stronger) → self-SELL; Wear new clothes → sell old items you just took off (ignore Precious items). ⚠️ Sold forever.":vY(3989),"💪 High Power Wear (ignore stats)":vY(1998),"Turn on: as long as the combat POWER is higher, you can wear it yourself, ignore the stats (weaker items → sell). Off: according to the index you choose.":"On: equipa qualquer item com PODER maior, ignorando atributos (mais fraco → vendido). Off: segue os atributos escolhidos.","Roll out items that PASS the filter (select below) AND match the stats → equip yourself. Just wear.":vY(3152),"📌 Don't see the index yet? Open the Light the Lamp stage in the game once and then open this menu again.":vY(2024),"🔮 Genie Roll — Filter Index":"🔮 Roll da Lampada — Filtro de Stat","Minimum quality":vY(3771),"Exquisite and above":"Requintado+","Rare or higher":"Raro+","Trac Viet and above":vY(3036),"Epic and above":vY(3326),"Legend and above":"Lendario+","Immortal and above":"Imortal+","Transcendent and above":"Transcendente+","Gold Plated or more":vY(721),"Eternal":vY(3377),"Filter condition 1 (need BOTH)":vY(1216),"Filter condition 2 (need BOTH)":vY(3894),"• Index 1.1":vY(2830),"• Index 1.2":"• Atributo 1.2","• Index 2.1":vY(3617),"• Index 2.2":vY(4145),"▶️ Turn on Auto Roll (self-roll game + sell trash)":vY(3429),"🗑️ Selling Replaced Old Items":"🗑️ Vender Item Antigo Substituído","When wearing new clothes → sell old items you just took off (ignore Precious items). ⚠️ Sold forever.":vY(1159),"Select index = automatically record in game filter. Turn on '⚙️ Auto Roll' + '▶️ Auto Roll' to run.":vY(2517),"Roll out items that PASS the filter (choose below) AND are stronger than the item you are wearing → equip yourself. Just wear.":vY(760),"⚙️ It's Better to Dress Yourself in Genie Clothes":"⚙️ Auto-Equipar Itens Melhores da Lampada","After lighting the lamp, roll out an item that MEETS the filtering conditions (set in the Auto Roll game screen) AND is stronger than the item you are wearing → equip yourself. Only wear, not sell.":vY(1825),"🎉 Auto Gift Khai Phu Server":vY(3642),"New server access account: self-receive recovery gift (server opening mission + RankRush milestone race + recovery login). Only accept server gifts that have been opened.":vY(3780),"🚫 Turn off Instructions":"🚫 Pular Tutorial","Skip the tutorial/forced pointing (check yourself done). Suitable for long time players / new server jump.":"Pula o tutorial forçado / guias de dedo apontando (marca como concluído). Paexit veteexitnos / pular paexit servidores novos.","🪙 Instant Gold Pump (Main Screen)":vY(1565),"Stand MAIN SCREEN: game slash 1 monster → mod PUMP straight to the golden cap in a few seconds. ⚠️ Abnormal speed = RISK of account blocking — should try secondary account first.":vY(4308),"Standing at the MAIN SCREEN: automatically turn on Farm Gold Lite (one-shot monster) farm gold until the day's cap is FULL and then turn off automatically.":vY(3641),"🪙 Automatic Farm Gold (AFK)":vY(3757),"Play the Gold Chapter repeatedly with Farm Gold Lite (one-shot) until the day's turn is ENDED and then TURN OFF. Manually turn on 'Farm Gold Lite'. Need to stand at the main stage.":vY(681),"🛡️ Antiban":"🛡️ Antiban","Force checkCheat = false (not forced to edit memory). You can NOT beat the self-calculated content server (escort/boss/high level).":vY(4254),"Ap Tieu (Guild)":vY(2963),"Reroll the quest to reach a high rank → exit → claim + fight monsters. Monster battles WITH rendering (rewind using Battle Speed). Need to be in STATE + on time.":vY(3906),"Boss bang ~20:20–21:00: shooting props (sure) + boss fight (hard to win). YES render. Need to be in STATE + on time boss.":vY(3495),"🎁 Gift Code":vY(2479),"🎁 Get Game Code Yourself (server)":vY(3849),"Get the admin code posted on the server yourself → redeem yourself (ONLY 1 time/acc, no spam). Turn it on and you're done, no need to tap; Changing your account is also self-identified.":vY(4224),"— Or enter your OWN code below —":vY(2217),"🎁 Enter Gift Code":vY(546),"Paste the code (1 per line, or separated by space/comma)":vY(3116),"🎁 Enter all codes":vY(3693),"Paste multiple codes → press the button, the mod automatically sends each one (~1.5 seconds). The code is SAVED → to change the account, just press the button to enter it all. The game automatically says OK / used / wrong.":vY(427),"🗡️ Auto Thief Assault (Boss)":vY(2884),"Bang boss (Thieves Assault, ~20:20–21:00): self-shoot props/bullets at your clan boss (DAMAGE IS DETERMINED, no force required) + attack the boss yourself (choose difficulty to win). ⚠️ Boss fights WITH rendering (rewind with 'Battle Speed'), REAL combat power. NEED to enter STATE + on time boss.":"Boss da guilda (Ataque dos Bandidos, ~20:20–21:00): doa munição/itens automaticamente ao boss da guilda (dano DETERMINÍSTICO, sem precisar de poder) + luta com o boss (escolhe uma dificuldade vencível). ⚠️ As lutas de boss APARECEM (acelere com 'Velocidade de Batalha'), fighte por PODER REAL. Precisa de GUILDA + a janela do boss.","🚚 Auto Road Bonus":"🚚 Auto Estrada de Recompensas (Guilda)","Event Bonus Path (guild): reroll low-rank tasks to high → exit → claim rewards + fight monsters yourself to earn extra points. ⚠️ The monster battle DOES appear (fast forward using 'Battle Speed') — fight with REAL force, strong acc wins quickly. NEED to enter STATE + on time for the event.":vY(3193),"Guild Suppression Event: reroll low-rank tasks to high → exit → receive rewards + fight monsters yourself to earn more points. ⚠️ The monster battle DOES appear (fast forward using 'Battle Speed') — fight with REAL force, strong acc wins quickly. NEED to enter STATE + on time for the event.":vY(3227),"Fight monsters on the road — NO turns/stamina wasted, fight until the monster dies = FREE Fame. ⚠️ The battle WILL SHOW up (the game doesn't let you skip) + REAL FORCE combat → should only turn on when the acc is STRONG (quickly win 1-2 attacks). Need to turn on 'Auto Pressure'.":vY(847),"• Defeat Monster Pressure (free)":vY(3225),"Fight monsters on the road — NO turns/stamina wasted. Each attack REDUCTES the monster's HP, hitting REPEAT until the monster DIES = extra FREE Fame (including weak power). Running in the background, blocking rendering. Need to turn on 'Auto Pressure' above.":vY(960),"Guild Pressure Event: self-reroll low-rank tasks to high → exit → self-receive rewards. Run underground, DO NOT open battle. NEED to enter STATE + on time for the event to open.":"Evento de Escolta da guilda: rerola missões de categoria baixa por uma melhor → despacha → coleta recompensas. Roda em segundo plano, sem batalhas. Precisa de GUILDA + janela do evento aberta.","🚚 Auto Pressure Pressure (State)":vY(1226),"Guild Pressure Event: self-reroll mission to high rank → exit → receive reward; + self-attack monsters (report victory) to TRY to force a win. NEED to enter STATE + on time for the event to open.":vY(3425),"• Pass in the correct grade; If you run out of boxes, WAIT + notify. Automatic = best beach with umbrellas. OFF = manual parking.":vY(4114),"Keep your chosen car waiting for Lien SV to open (10:00 a.m.–10:00 p.m. server), DO NOT park in another lot. OFF = when closed, still parking, usually making money.":"Seguexit o carro escolhido paexit o Inter-Servidor (aberto 10:00–22:00 do servidor), brain estaciona em outexits vagas. DESLIGADO = estaciona pexit render enquanto fechado.","Selected class END OF box → self-occupies the box of the WEAKER person. ⚠️ PvP, costs tickets (cap 3, 2 hours), only bet to win.":"Categoria escolhida LOTADA → ataca a vaga de um jogador MAIS FRACO. ⚠️ PvP, gasta ticket (máx 3, recupeexit 2h), number alvos vencíveis.","• Capture = steal the box (PvP) when full, only attack the weaker player (according to Safety Level), need to have tickets left. Button = take now; Toggle = self-occupied.":vY(2834),"Self-Occupation When The Beach Is Full":vY(2547),"When the selected Lien SV field runs out of spaces → automatically takes over the space of the person WEAKER than you. ⚠️ It's PvP, it COSTS tickets (cap 3, 2 hours); Only play when you are sure to win.":"Quando a vaga Inter-Servidor da categoria escolhida estiver CHEIA → ataca automaticamente a vaga de um jogador MAIS FRACO paexit tomá-la. ⚠️ É PvP, gasta um ticket (máx 3, recupeexit 2 hours); so ataca alvos vencíveis.","The safety level accounts for":"Nível de seguexitnça","Safe (enemy <85% of own strength)":vY(3530),"Very strong (enemy <70%)":vY(470),"Dose (enemy <95%)":"Arriscado (inimigo <95%)","⚔️ Occupy Bai Nang (1 time)":vY(2309),"• Take the field = ATTACK the space (PvP) when the field is full. You can't force a win — the mod only hits the WEAKER player (according to 'Safe Level'). Lien SV TICKETS are required. Button = immediately occupies 1 cell; Toggle = automatically occupied when full.":vY(2614),"Gilded Beach":vY(3652),"Silver Beach":vY(3863),"Bai Dong":vY(3374),"• Choose to park in the RIGHT lot: Diamond / Gold Plated / Silver / Bronze. When you run out of selected parking slots, WAIT until there is an empty slot (no fee for other parking tickets). 'Auto' = best beach with umbrellas available. OFF = you park your hand.":vY(849),"Keep the Lien SV bus waiting to open":vY(1501),"Turn on + selected 'Vehicle parked in Lien SV' → that car WAITS until Lien SV opens (10:00 a.m. - 10:00 p.m. server time) to park, DO NOT park in regular/friends/public parking lot when Lien SV is closed. (OFF = when LSV is closed, it still parks in other parking lots to make money.)":vY(362),"🔨 Auto Shroom Spirit Trials":vY(2919),"Win the Shroom Spirit Trials minigame yourself: enter the level and announce victory, no need to play hands → receive reward. Runs while the event is open.":vY(1892),"Bai Lien SV":vY(3191),"Automatic (best available)":vY(2166),"Diamond Beach":vY(561),"Golden Beach":vY(3652),"Bai Thuong":vY(806),"OFF (you put your hand on it)":vY(3972),"• Choose to park in the RIGHT lot: Diamond / Yellow / Regular. When you run out of selected parking slots, WAIT until there is an empty slot (no fee for other parking tickets). 'Auto' = best beach with umbrellas available. OFF = you park your hand.":vY(1082),"1 button: self-jump to attack + free revive + self-find when out of bait. Need is on the battlefield.":vY(1356),"275 = discard the card ≤275 VND, the higher card still plays. 0 = hit all. The bot automatically learns points when playing.":vY(1986),"Auto Chien Lien Server":vY(1769),"Auto Ma Bao Tam Tran":vY(1676),"Auto PVP (weak state fighting)":vY(3424),"Auto Thief Chaser":vY(4334),"BOSS has a lot of health and takes a lot of attacks. Default is OFF (original auto is also ignored).":vY(2158),"Boss → Weak → Monster":vY(3442),"Boss → Monster (high score first) → Human":"Boss → Monstros (mais pontos primeiro) → Jogadores","ONLY Good Monsters (boss + high score, trash monsters removed)":vY(1856),"ONLY when there are teammates on the same map: ask for help (free) + help back to get points. Play alone and skip it.":"SÓ com companheiros no mesmo mapa: pede ajuda (grátis) + ajud