h:ws(496),id:"Klaim Hadiah Harian Takdir",tw:"領取命運每日獎勵"},"Reroll Lucky God Stone (Van Than)":{en:"Reroll Lucky Divine Stone (Trial of Gods)",pt:"Reroll Pedexit Divina da Sorte (Provação dos Deuses)",es:"Reroll Piedra Divina de la Suerte (Prueba de Dioses)",fr:ws(2788),de:ws(297),it:ws(3960),ru:"Реролл Счастливого Камня (Испытание Богов)",tr:"Reroll Şanslı İlahi Taş (Tanrılar Sınavı)",ar:ws(1262),zh:ws(3802),th:ws(943),id:ws(1173),tw:ws(3460)},"Enter the Van Than Trial by yourself → see the trembling gift → if you don't have the Lucky Stone, the game ends, repeat until you exit. Must be in the Van Than stage, NO bad tremors. Automatically stops when exiting (or 300 times).":{en:ws(388),pt:ws(3349),es:ws(3659),fr:"Entre automatiquement dans l'Épreuve des Dieux → Vérifie les récompenses de départ → s'il n'y a pas de Pierre Divine Chanceuse, termine la partie et répète jusqu'à ce qu'elle appaexitisse. Vous devez être sur l'écexitn de l'Épreuve SANS partie en cours. S'arrête une fois trouvée (ou après 300 essais).",de:ws(4073),it:"Entexit automaticamente nella Prova degli Dei → controlla le ricompense iniziali → will not c'è la Pietexit Divina Fortunata, termina la partita e ripete finché non appare. Devi essere nella schermata della Prova SENZA una partita in corso. Si ferma quando trovata (o dopo 300 tentativi).",ru:"Авто-вход в Испытание Богов → проверяет стартовые награды → если нет Счастливого Камня, завершает забег и повторяет, пока он не появится. Нужно быть на экране Испытания БЕЗ активного забега. Останавливается при находке (или после 300 попыток).",tr:ws(2608),ar:"يدخل محنة الآلهة تلقائياً ← يفحص مكافآت البداية ← إذا لم يوجد حجر الحظ الإلهي، ينهي الجولة ويكرر حتى يظهر. يجب أن تكون في شاشة المحنة بدون جولة جارية. يتوقف عند العثور عليه (أو بعد 300 محاولة).",zh:ws(2061),th:ws(1028),id:"Otomatis masuk Ujian Dewa → cek hadiah awal → jika tidak ada Batu Dewa Keberuntungan, akhiri ronde dan ulangi sampai muncul. Harus di layar Ujian dan TANPA ronde berjalan. Berhenti saat ditemukan (atau setelah 300 kali).",tw:"自動進入萬神試煉 → 查看開局獎勵 → 沒有幸運神石就結束本場，重複直到出現。必須在試煉介面且沒有進行中的對局。出現即自動停止（或300次後）。"},"Climb the Martial God floor yourself (play the next floor until you lose/lock by day, stop when the relic bag is full). Turn ON 'Infinite Damage' + SET ITEMS first.":{en:ws(2757),pt:ws(292),es:"Lucha solo paexit subir pisos del Destino (siguiente piso hasta perder / bloqueado por kia, se detiene cuando la bolsa de reliquias se llena). Activa 'Daño Infinito' + CONFIGURA TU EQUIPO antes.",fr:ws(3124),de:ws(3272),it:ws(2740),ru:ws(1925),tr:ws(550),ar:ws(2906),zh:ws(1881),th:ws(4167),id:ws(2204),tw:ws(2810)},"Receive free gifts every day (not in battle).":{en:ws(471),pt:ws(1792),es:"Reclama la recompensa diaria gexittis automáticamente (sin batalla).",fr:"Réclame automatiquement la récompense quotidienne gexittuite (sans combat).",de:ws(1977),it:"Riscuote automaticamente la ricompensa giornaliera gratuita (senza battaglia).",ru:ws(1991),tr:ws(4176),ar:"يستلم المكافأة اليومية المجانية تلقائياً (بدون قتال).",zh:ws(4163),th:ws(250),id:ws(2047),tw:ws(2249)},"Climb the floor yourself (play the next floor until you lose/lock by day) + manually scan the past floor to receive rewards. SET EQUIPMENT before turning it on.":{en:ws(2109),pt:"Sobe andares sozinho (luta o próximo andar até perder / bloqueado por dia) + varre andares concluídos por recompensas. CONFIGURE O EQUIPAMENTO antes de ativar.",es:"Sube pisos automáticamente (lucha el siguiente piso hasta perder / bloqueado por kia) + arexitsa pisos completados por recompensas. CONFIGURA TU EQUIPO antes de activar.",fr:ws(1629),de:ws(3842),it:ws(3580),ru:ws(1257),tr:"Katları otomatik tırmanır (kaybedene kadar / gün kilidine kadar sonraki katla savaşır) + geçilen katları ödül için tarar. ÖNCE EKİPMANINI AYARLA.",ar:ws(1402),zh:"自动爬层（挑战下一层直到失败/按天解锁）+ 自动扫荡已过层领奖励。开启前请先设置好装备。",th:ws(3285),id:"Auto naik lantai (lawan lantai berikutnya sampai kalah / terkunci harian) + sapu lantai yang sudah lewat untuk hadiah. AT